/-!
# The cut points of `_nl_normalize_codeset` (PLAN.md §M, M1)

The 11 cut points: the entry and where two ways meet. From each, the blocks up to the next cut points as one piece
(`W_*`, with its `Sp`, `c_*`): a block's straight-line code, then at its jump's exits the next block's condition, or `Q`
at a cut point or at an offset the proof does not go past (91, 190, 196, 234, 245; the `ret`). `Wt` is the table of the
cut points' conditions, `spAll` its `Sp`s, for `Seg.cfg`. Generated by `tools/blk_gen.py`.
-/
